      <section class="case-detail-grid single-column">
        <div class="bullet-panel">
          <h2 class="en">Strategy & Execution</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">策略与执行</h2>
          <ul class="en">
            <li><strong>Focus on pages with buying intent: </strong>Used GSC, GA4, keywords, and customer needs to find promising commercial pages. Improved English content, metadata, URLs, and internal links. Organic traffic grew 75%, and organic inquiries grew 100%.</li>
            <li><strong>Use lead quality to improve ads: </strong>Traced invalid inquiries to search terms, audiences, websites, apps, and placements. Updated negative keywords and exclusion rules. Monthly ad spend fell about 33%, while qualified lead volume and quality stayed stable.</li>
            <li><strong>Fix technical barriers to indexing: </strong>Found technical issues that affected crawling and indexing. Improved pages and site structure, bringing core-page indexation to 100%.</li>
            <li><strong>Keep a regular review and feedback process: </strong>Combined SEO, ad, and inquiry data in Google Sheets and Looker Studio. Used weekly reviews to plan page and campaign changes. A new ad group generated seven qualified leads.</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="zh">
            <li><strong>优先优化有采购意图的页面：</strong>结合 GSC、GA4、关键词和客户需求，识别高潜力商业页面，优化英文内容、元数据、URL 与内链，推动自然流量增长75%、自然询盘增长100%。</li>
            <li><strong>从询盘质量反推广告调整：</strong>将无效询盘与搜索词、受众、网站、App 和展示位置对应，持续更新否定关键词及排除规则。在有效线索数量与质量保持稳定的情况下，月度广告支出降低约33%。</li>
            <li><strong>将技术审计转化为收录改善：</strong>排查影响抓取和收录的技术问题，推进页面及网站结构修复，将核心页面收录率提升至100%。</li>
            <li><strong>建立持续监控与反馈机制：</strong>通过 Google Sheets、Looker Studio 和每周复盘，连接 SEO、广告及询盘数据，将发现的问题转化为页面调整和投放任务。新建广告组获得7个有效线索。</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="case-note en">After optimization, monthly Google Ads spend was approximately $5.7K; a newly created ad group generated 7 qualified leads.</p>
